'''Drowning''' refers to two different debuffs. One is a damaging mechanical debuff that is found exclusively in [[Seething Chyme]], and the other is a lethal debuff that can kill a [[character]] instantly after a few seconds, inflicted by Drowning Orbs or drowning water in [[The Fathomless Depths (area)|The Fathomless Depths]] areas.
==The Infinite Hunger version==
{{status
| name                   = Drowning
| type                   = Debuff
| icon                   = Drowning infinite hunger status icon.png
| description            = You are being slowed and suffocated by grasping bile.
}}

'''Drowning''' is a [[debuff]] that gradually immobilises the character and deals physical and chaos damage over time. It is inflicted by waves of bile in the arena of [[The Infinite Hunger]], [[Seething Chyme]]. Upon hitting 10 stacks, the player is "pulled under" into an underground maze area.
{{clear}}
==Drowning Orb version==
{{status
| name                   = Drowning
| type                   = Debuff
| icon                   = Drowning eater of worlds status icon.png
| description            = You are drowning and will die soon
}}
[[File:Drowning Orb screenshot.png|thumb|100px|A Drowning Orb.]]

The moving Drowning Orbs inflict a debuff called "Drowning" on contact, which causes a 75% [[action speed]] slow and automatically kills the player after 3 seconds if they do not move away in time. While facing away from Drowning Orbs, they will slowly float towards the character; when facing towards them, they will back up a fixed distance away.

Drowning Orbs can be found in [[the Eater of Worlds]]' arena [[Absence of Symmetry and Harmony]], or maps with mod {{ml|MapUberModDrowningOrbs}}, which can roll on [[nightmare map]]s or [[Originator-influenced map]]s with the {{ml|MapZanaInfluenced|display=stat_text}} implicit.
{{clear}}

==Curse of the Allflame version==
{{status
| name                   = Drowning
| type                   = Debuff
| icon                   = Drowning eater of worlds status icon.png
| description            = You are drowning and will die soon
}}

Underwater areas not lit up by an Allflame Lantern inflict a debuff called "Drowning" on contact, which causes a 50% [[action speed]] slow and automatically kills the player after 5 seconds if they do not move back to a safe area in time.

Drowning water can be found in [[The Fathomless Depths (area)|The Fathomless Depths]] as part of the [[Curse of the Allflame]] mechanic.
{{clear}}

